{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31377","headline":"飞鸿响远音 · 李体仁","name":"飞鸿响远音","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠微霜夕，翩翩出渚鸿。\n清声流逈野，高韵入寥空。\n旧质经寒塞，残音响远风。\n萦云犹类网，避月尚疑弓。\n弱羽虽能振，丹霄竟未通。\n欲知多怨思，听取暮烟中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李体仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}